-#    centers are closer to their assigned palette than to the opposite one.
-#
+#    The generator reserves one horizontal edge and one vertical edge, keeps a
+#    one-cell bg gap from the shared corner area, and places sprites with the same
+#    non-overlap / non-boundary-hole checks as the original task. This guarantees
+#    both palettes remain isolated and that no sprite is mistaken for a palette.
